        desc: "If on-site inspection reveals complex internal engine, gearbox, or suspension damage, our dedicated Al Satwa facility provides complete garage resources, lifting ramps, and prioritised booking."
    },
    {
        icon: "mapPin",
        title: "Central Dubai Dispatch & Seven-Day Service",
        desc: "Centrally positioned at 222 Al Satwa Road, we operate 7:00 AM to 10:00 PM every day, providing responsive mobile coverage across residential communities, business towers, and roadside locations."
    }
];

const faqs = [
    {
        q: "How quickly can a mobile mechanic reach my location in Dubai?",
        a: "Technicians are dispatched directly from our central workshop at 222 Al Satwa Road. Typical transit times range between 25 and 45 minutes for central neighbourhoods such as Jumeirah, Karama, Downtown, and Business Bay, and 40 to 60 minutes for outer districts like Dubai Marina, JVC, or Mirdif. Actual arrival times depend on traffic conditions on major arterial routes including Sheikh Zayed Road (E11) and Al Khail Road (E44). [CONFIRM: average dispatch times and peak traffic buffer]"
    },
    {
        q: "What is the call-out fee for mobile car repair in Dubai?",
        a: "Our standard mobile call-out fee is AED 30 [CONFIRM: call-out fee amount and travel radius]. This fee covers technician travel, arrival at your designated vehicle location, and initial physical assessment. If diagnostic scanning, fluid testing, or replacement parts are required, an itemised quote is provided for your approval before any repair work commences."
    },
    {
        q: "Can a mobile mechanic repair car AC problems on-site?",
        a: "Our mobile team can perform manifold pressure gauge testing, electrical checks on the compressor clutch and relays, and refrigerant top-ups (R134a or R1234yf) on systems that hold vacuum and pressure. However, if your air conditioning system has suffered an active refrigerant leak, compressor seizure, or evaporator core failure, the vehicle must be brought to our Al Satwa workshop for nitrogen pressure testing, leak tracing, and recovery station servicing."
    },
    {
        q: "What vehicle information should I provide when booking mobile service?",
        a: "Please share your exact parking location (building name, street, or WhatsApp GPS pin), your vehicle make, model, and year of manufacture, and a clear description of the issue-such as whether the engine cranks, any active dashboard warning lights, unusual noises, or visible fluid leaks. This ensures the responding technician arrives with the correct battery group size, scan software, and fluid specifications for your vehicle."
    },
    {
        q: "Is mobile car repair more expensive than visiting your workshop?",
        a: "Our hourly labour and parts pricing remain consistent between mobile call-outs and our physical Al Satwa workshop. The only difference is the nominal mobile call-out charge [CONFIRM: call-out fee amount]. For vehicles that cannot start or are unsafe to drive, mobile repair is frequently more economical than paying for third-party flatbed towing across Dubai."
    },
    {
        q: "Can you carry out repairs inside covered residential or basement parking?",
        a: "Yes, provided the building management permits mobile vehicle maintenance and there is adequate ceiling clearance and ventilation. We perform battery installations, diagnostic scans, filter replacements, and minor electrical repairs cleanly using protective mats and containment tools. Fully enclosed basement levels without mechanical airflow are restricted from engine run tests or fluid changes for environmental and safety compliance."
    }
];

const relatedServices = [
    { icon: "battery", name: "Mobile Battery Service Dubai", desc: "On-site battery testing, supply & installation across Dubai", href: "/car-battery-replacement-dubai" },
    { icon: "alert", name: "Roadside Assistance Dubai", desc: "Emergency assistance for breakdowns, punctures & jump starts", href: "/roadside-assistance-dubai" },
    { icon: "oil", name: "Oil Change Service Dubai", desc: "Lube service with OEM filter & certified fluid disposal", href: "/engine-oil-change-dubai" },
    { icon: "snowflake", name: "Car AC Gas Refill Dubai", desc: "On-site manifold pressure test and refrigerant recharge", href: "/car-ac-repair-dubai" }
];

